# America/New_York (TZ set in the image). Every job is idempotent: catch-up decides only missing
# sessions, rebalance trades once per month (broker-side client_order_id check), snapshot is append-only.
# Daily-model forward test: catch-up once the 1-minute store accepts today (post_close 20:00 + 16 min),
# a retry, and a morning pass that also covers early-close days and outages.
30 20 * * 1-5  /app/deploy/entrypoint.sh job megacap
30 22 * * 1-5  /app/deploy/entrypoint.sh job megacap
0 8 * * *      /app/deploy/entrypoint.sh job megacap
# ETF forward test (F1/F2 vs 60/40): prices + month-end snapshot.
45 17 * * 1-5  /app/deploy/entrypoint.sh job etf
# 60/40 paper rebalance: hourly during the first 5 sessions of the month (script gates the window).
5 10-15 * * 1-5 /app/deploy/entrypoint.sh job rebalance
# SMS control (2026-11-02): owner texts are polled every minute (approvals, PAUSE/RESUME/FLATTEN, STATUS).
* * * * *      /app/deploy/entrypoint.sh job sms
# Approved-book proposals: turn-of-month on its sessions (morning), ETF sleeves after the snapshot.
# (megacap proposes right after its own job above.)
40 9 * * 1-5   /app/deploy/entrypoint.sh job tom
55 17 * * 1-5  /app/deploy/entrypoint.sh job etfbook
# Daily digest after the megacap run has decided and marked.
# Fast alert-fade book: official settlement once SIP bars of the session are final (post 20:00 ET).
40 20 * * 1-5  /app/deploy/entrypoint.sh job fadesettle
50 20 * * 1-5  /app/deploy/entrypoint.sh job digest
